  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14466352",
      "title": "Handling Errors",
      "lectureOrder": 589,
      "videoOrder": 542,
      "sourceHash": "20ff3bd6c7a76ca14fe8f809a8b749dbdeaf34262db3d7afc59cb67cfa780cb5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "Instructor: Thus far our requests always succeeded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "But of course when interacting with servers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 9.72,
          "en": "things can go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "You might not have an internet connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 15.36,
          "en": "or you're sending a request with incorrect data somehow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.36,
          "end": 18.69,
          "en": "because you have a bug in your program or whatever it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.69,
          "end": 20.43,
          "en": "or your server fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.43,
          "end": 23.22,
          "en": "Maybe it's offline or there's an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 25.83,
          "en": "on the server or you are not authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 28.89,
          "en": "There are dozens of things that can go wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.89,
          "end": 32.61,
          "en": "and we can simulate such a thing that can go wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.61,
          "end": 34.23,
          "en": "by going to Firebase,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 35.61,
          "en": "and there in the database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 37.14,
          "en": "let's go to Rules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.14,
          "end": 39.93,
          "en": "And remember that when we created that database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.93,
          "end": 41.43,
          "en": "we enabled test mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.43,
          "end": 44.34,
          "en": "which essentially means that read and write access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.34,
          "end": 47.04,
          "en": "to this database is granted to everyone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 50.01,
          "en": "You don't need to authenticate yourself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.01,
          "end": 51.96,
          "en": "Now, we will add authentication",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 54.96,
          "en": "in the authentication module later in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.96,
          "end": 58.29,
          "en": "and therefore for now we open this up to everyone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.29,
          "end": 60.45,
          "en": "Now, if I lock this down though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 63.81,
          "en": "so if I say you're not allowed, to read for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 66.143,
          "en": "you can still write but you're not allowed to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.143,
          "end": 67.98,
          "en": "And by setting this to false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 70.77,
          "en": "there is no condition under which you would ever be allowed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.77,
          "end": 72.99,
          "en": "not even if you are authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.99,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "So if I lock this down, what happens is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 79.35,
          "en": "if I now try to fetch posts here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.35,
          "end": 81.24,
          "en": "you see we get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.24,
          "end": 85.17,
          "en": "and that of course happens, errors occur.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.17,
          "end": 88.95,
          "en": "But it is important how we react to that error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 93.12,
          "en": "For now, for example, here we stay in this loading state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.12,
          "end": 95.28,
          "en": "and that is not a great user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.28,
          "end": 97.97999999999999,
          "en": "because now we as a user have no idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.97999999999999,
          "end": 101.31,
          "en": "that there was an error and that something failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.31,
          "end": 104.13,
          "en": "Therefore, proper error handling matters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.13,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "Now, how can we handle errors?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "There are different ways of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 111.517,
          "en": "Let me demonstrate the first possible way here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.517,
          "end": 115.92,
          "en": "\"onFetchPosts\" fails because, well, we have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.92,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "Thus far, we only passed one function to subscribe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "and that is the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "that fires when new data is emitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 124.65,
          "en": "Now, as you learned in the observables section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.65,
          "end": 126.757,
          "en": "you can pass more arguments to subscribe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.757,
          "end": 129.33,
          "en": "and the second argument is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.33,
          "end": 132.6,
          "en": "that triggers whenever an error is thrown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.6,
          "end": 135.66,
          "en": "and there we will get the error object as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.66,
          "end": 139.23,
          "en": "And now here we can do something to handle that error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.23,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "To do something, to provide a better user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.36,
          "en": "interface or a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 147.39,
          "en": "And that often starts with a better user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.39,
          "end": 149.97,
          "en": "So, for example here what we could do is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 149.97,
          "end": 152.82,
          "en": "we could display an error message instead of loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 155.25,
          "en": "So down there where we display loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 155.25,
          "end": 157.65,
          "en": "or the content we loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.65,
          "end": 162.03,
          "en": "we could actually introduce a new property error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.03,
          "end": 163.92000000000002,
          "en": "and set this to null initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 163.92000000000002,
          "end": 167.22,
          "en": "So, we have no error initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 167.22,
          "end": 168.48,
          "en": "if this is not now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 168.48,
          "end": 169.77,
          "en": "So, if we do have an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 169.77,
          "end": 172.23,
          "en": "and we'll add logic to change that soon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 172.23,
          "end": 173.97,
          "en": "I want to add a div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 173.97,
          "end": 177,
          "en": "with the class as alert and alert danger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 177,
          "end": 179.04,
          "en": "which are bootstrap classes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 179.04,
          "end": 181.35,
          "en": "where I simply have let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 181.35,
          "end": 185.523,
          "en": "h1 tag, an error occurred.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 186.54,
          "end": 189.87,
          "en": "And below that I wanna output error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 189.87,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "because error in my case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 194.07,
          "en": "in this application here could just be an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 194.07,
          "end": 196.68,
          "en": "And of course it's up to you how you exactly manage that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 196.68,
          "end": 198.57,
          "en": "and what you store in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 198.57,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "Now, the idea is that this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 203.94,
          "en": "this div is only shown if we have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 203.94,
          "end": 207.32999999999998,
          "en": "So if error is true-ish, which it is not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 207.32999999999998,
          "end": 208.41,
          "en": "if it is null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.41,
          "end": 209.4,
          "en": "Initially it's null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 209.4,
          "end": 211.71,
          "en": "and therefore, it's treated as a false value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 211.71,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "and therefore initially this will not show up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 216.6,
          "en": "But as soon as we set this to some string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 216.6,
          "end": 219.96,
          "en": "it becomes true-ish and then this will show up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 219.96,
          "end": 222.06,
          "en": "This all means that I only want to show loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 222.06,
          "end": 226.14,
          "en": "if we are fetching and we're not having an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 226.14,
          "end": 228.96,
          "en": "Because if we have an error, I never wanna show loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 228.96,
          "end": 231.543,
          "en": "I want to show my alert here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 232.56,
          "end": 235.98,
          "en": "Now, the remaining step is to set that error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 235.98,
          "end": 237.39,
          "en": "and of course I want to do this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 237.39,
          "end": 239.85,
          "en": "in my error handling function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 239.85,
          "end": 244.74,
          "en": "And I will simply set this error, \"equal.message\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 244.74,
          "end": 247.56,
          "en": "because by default error objects have a message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 247.56,
          "end": 249.78,
          "en": "The question is if that message is helpful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 249.78,
          "end": 253.29,
          "en": "but at least we can set this message for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 253.29,
          "end": 257.58,
          "en": "Now, important, of course we are fetching post not just here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 257.58,
          "end": 260.52,
          "en": "but all \"ngOnInit\", so there we should add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 260.52,
          "end": 262.76,
          "en": "the second argument as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 262.76,
          "end": 264.69,
          "en": "And with that, let's have a look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 264.69,
          "end": 266.01,
          "en": "Let's wait for that to reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 266.01,
          "end": 267.96,
          "en": "And here it is already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 267.96,
          "end": 268.92,
          "en": "Now, of course you can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 268.92,
          "end": 270.78,
          "en": "this is the error message we're getting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 272.76,
          "en": "Might not be too useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 272.76,
          "end": 274.53,
          "en": "You can definitely tweak that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 274.53,
          "end": 277.14,
          "en": "you can show your own error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 277.14,
          "end": 280.29,
          "en": "You can dive into that in more details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 280.29,
          "end": 281.67,
          "en": "and if you for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 281.67,
          "end": 284.878,
          "en": "need more information from the error response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 284.878,
          "end": 289.878,
          "en": "Well, let's have a look at the error we got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 289.92,
          "end": 291.63,
          "en": "Let me save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 291.63,
          "end": 293.34000000000003,
          "en": "Now if a fetch posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 293.34000000000003,
          "end": 295.11,
          "en": "this is getting locked and you see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 295.11,
          "end": 299.34000000000003,
          "en": "what I log here is indeed a full error response object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 299.34000000000003,
          "end": 302.28,
          "en": "Now there you see that message we accessed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 302.28,
          "end": 303.346,
          "en": "but you also see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 303.346,
          "end": 307.08,
          "en": "you got, for example, another error key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 307.08,
          "end": 308.55,
          "en": "with yet another error key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 308.55,
          "end": 311.61,
          "en": "that has maybe a more helpful error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 311.61,
          "end": 313.8,
          "en": "This however is not guaranteed to exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 313.8,
          "end": 314.633,
          "en": "This only exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 314.633,
          "end": 318,
          "en": "because our error here is an error response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 318,
          "end": 320.13,
          "en": "So, the fire base server sending back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 320.13,
          "end": 322.29,
          "en": "a customized error response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 322.29,
          "end": 324.63,
          "en": "Now the important thing to memorize about that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 324.63,
          "end": 328.62,
          "en": "however is, you will get that HTTP error response object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 328.62,
          "end": 331.62,
          "en": "by angular and it will have an error key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 331.62,
          "end": 336,
          "en": "But the detailed content of what's in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 336,
          "end": 338.61,
          "en": "depends on the API you're talking to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 338.61,
          "end": 341.94,
          "en": "Fire base gives you an object with another error key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 341.94,
          "end": 343.68,
          "en": "and that permission denied message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 343.68,
          "end": 346.32,
          "en": "Your own API might not be sending this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 346.32,
          "end": 348.06,
          "en": "or might be sending different data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 348.06,
          "end": 349.666,
          "en": "So, it's always important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 349.666,
          "end": 352.2,
          "en": "which API you are working with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 352.2,
          "end": 354.39,
          "en": "and what this API sends back",
          "zh": ""
